s, two providers, and a broadcast that resumes from\nthe rows still queued — nothing is sent twice.</p>\n</div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sourceplane/virga\" class=\"hover:text-ink\">sourceplane/virga</a><span class=\"ml-2\">#<!-- -->email</span></p></li></ul></div></main><footer class=\"mt-16 border-t border-line\"><div class=\"container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 py-8 text-sm text-muted\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <a href=\"https://github.com/sourceplane\" class=\"hover:text-ink\">The owner</a></p><p class=\"flex gap-4\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sourceplane/virga\" class=\"hover:text-ink\">GitHub</a><a href=\"/rss.xml\" class=\"hover:text-ink\">RSS</a></p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-6fb70f4dc654ae84.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n3:I[3755,[\\\"755\\\",\\\"static/chunks/755-108e0d870f2b8b99.js\\\",\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-24ce5470898ce9b3.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[5320,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[2574,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[6233,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n8:I[6233,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\na:I[6233,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[3047,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/09db01a0de40d5b1.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"uCqbQ-wdj6EUcgtBVZXUw\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"projects\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"projects\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$2\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/09db01a0de40d5b1.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null